# Only what the image needs (Dockerfile COPY lines) reaches the build; everything here is excluded from the context.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/coverage
# runtime data, secrets and local outputs — never in an image
# (at any depth: a stray apps/web/.env.local would otherwise reach the build stage, and Vite reads it)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
data
apps/server/data
backups
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.db
*.db-*
eval-reports
playwright-report
test-results
e2e
fixtures
tools
docs
apps/web/test-screenshots
apps/web/dev
**/test
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
.DS_Store
*.log
